\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.1}{\ignorespaces Overview of the HCPC-RLVR training pipeline. A chart image and question enter the system; the proposed model generates $K=8$ rollouts; each rollout is parsed into chart type, table, reasoning, and answer; the fully-correct subset feeds HCPC; and the aggregated reward drives the policy update. Current experiments use $K=4$ rollouts because of compute constraints.}}{18}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{3.1}{18}{Overview of the HCPC-RLVR training pipeline. A chart image and question enter the system; the proposed model generates $K=8$ rollouts; each rollout is parsed into chart type, table, reasoning, and answer; the fully-correct subset feeds HCPC; and the aggregated reward drives the policy update. Current experiments use $K=4$ rollouts because of compute constraints}{figure.caption.6}{}}
